[moved to stan-dev]

The current release (2.9) does slice still.

Michael --- is the new multinomial approach "correcting" by including
the original state?  It's the only way I see that we could get the right
balance.

- Bob

> On May 2, 2016, at 7:44 PM, Michael Betancourt <betan...@gmail.com> wrote:
>
> It was slice up until the recent update, but they all yield the
> same marginal probabilities of selecting each state in a
> given trajectory.  In particular, all of these methods exactly
