The technical challenge is writing a wrapper function, so that each function in the Stan math library fits into TensorFlow’s C++ API. (See https://www.tensorflow.org/versions/r0.8/how_tos/adding_an_op/index.html). This would expose all of Stan math to TensorFlow’s interface in both C++ and Python. So short answer: yes, it’s possible, and I hope someone does it!

Dustin

