Neil Lawrence is right that it makes more sense, so if
there's agreement among those who teach it (he and Aki being
leaders in that endeavour), then by all means lets go with that.
So that'd be one of

  cov_exp_quad  OR  exp_quad_cov

I do not think we should call it cov_eq or eq_cov, because "eq"
is too confusable with "equals" and we've used "exp" and
"quad" and "cov" elsewhere.

- Bob

